ps://doi.org/10.1038/nrc.2023.001\">doi:10.1038/nrc.2023.001</a></li>\n  <li id=\"ref-r2\">Zhang L, et al. Novel approaches. Science. 2022;375:100-105.</li>\n  <li id=\"ref-r3\">A One, B Two, et al.. Four authors. <em>J Test</em>. (2020). 5</li>\n</ol>"
